wnT0kDiUIQITaZ6wCcS_gE7rrN8UqpK0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKU7mpCOmbs9JxlUj1m6Z8rBn2yt7v6xByezsfGhvm2PA&oe=6AA94E6D"}, {"file_name": "StoryMode.png", "id": "32811313745133632", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_32811313751800298_6861778986600558374_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LXneDx0H3qEQ7kNvwFTMl-0&_nc_oc=AdpUN15fEYFQ5b3GwulYKNF_nI_VZ_OO1dxWYaMNT9BDB4ysPyWc7oUkTfDu-t8v8q4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIGZ38sadzRxtrNr4vsJW45jjPRRjteYMC1ysrePW48YA&oe=6AA94EB7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GameThumbnail.png", "id": "864108156302774", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_864108159636107_8140054702670079169_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hBcMndHdzP8Q7kNvwHjuB5l&_nc_oc=AdoPXCdcYMmCJpBLpMDFzX2wozieM6Kppxw_601p-dM_c7d7XRZoT1efGwgB053JYNE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLI3VkERPB8OWy82VmdxPNGPmOYGqN-Mbd_dLguS9EpzQ&oe=6AA95EEC"}, "display_name": "Novalight", "keywords": ["Story", "Gamemodes", "Space", "Robots", "Adventure"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Novalight!\n\nNovalight is a free-to-play, hand-based movement multiplayer game that takes place thousands of years into the future where humans have gone extinct after a failed experiment caused the earth to explode.\n\n{2872839186238379}\n\n# Choose Your Own Path:\n\nJoin up to **20 players** in a public server or create a private one with friends!\n\nPlay through either the **Story Mode, Gamemodes** or perhaps just hangout & chat with friends in the lobby.\n\n{2244974466007548}\n\n# Customization:\n\nYou can customize your character with a wide variety of cosmetics!\n\nand may purchase them with **Nebulite** in the store!\nthere are many customization options in this game so you'll be able to create a great outfit and show it off to others!\n\nYou may also sele